@@ -4,3 +4,6 @@ We did this release dance three times this month, each time the same:
 3. git tag v$(node -p "require(\"./package.json\").version")
 4. npm run changelog -- --since-last-tag
 It failed once when step 2 was skipped and a 400 KB bundle shipped.
+
+Now automated: `npm run release` (add `-- --dry-run` to preview, `-- --max-kb N` to change the limit).
+The size check always runs and a failure stops the release before tagging. Tests: `npm run test:release`.
